Privacy Policy for Ageo
Effective Date: August 7, 2026
Last Updated: August 7, 2026

We are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how our mobile application handles user information.

1. Summary (Privacy by Design)
Ageo does NOT require an account or registration.
Your birth date, saved profiles, and time capsule notes are stored locally on your device.
We do NOT sell, rent, or monetize your personal data.
We do NOT track your location or access your camera, microphone, contacts, or storage files.
2. Information We Process
A. Information You Provide Directly
Date of Birth & Profiles: When you enter a birth date, it is stored locally on your device via local storage (SharedPreferences). It is used exclusively to calculate real-time age metrics, planetary ages, life milestones, and astrological/numerological insights.
Time Capsule Messages: Any messages you write to your future self are saved securely in your device’s local private storage and are never uploaded to any external server.
B. Artificial Intelligence (AI) Features
When you choose to use the optional AI Life Insights & Horoscope feature, the App sends your selected birth date to Google Generative AI (Gemini API) to generate structured life insights and horoscope text.
No personally identifiable information (such as your name, email, or device identifier) is ever transmitted to the AI service.
C. Automatically Collected Information
The App does not employ third-party advertising tracking or behavioral analytics SDKs. Standard, anonymized diagnostic and crash data may be collected by the operating system platform (Google Play Services / Apple App Store) in accordance with their respective privacy policies.
3. How We Use Your Information
We use the data you provide solely for the following purposes:

To calculate and display real-time age, time units, and astronomical milestones.
To compute life progress, biorhythm estimates, and numerology metrics.
To deliver user-requested AI life insights.
To maintain your saved birthday history and time capsules locally on your device.
4. Data Storage and Retention
Local Storage: All personal preferences, dates of birth, and time capsules remain strictly within your device's sandboxed local application storage.
Data Deletion: You have complete control over your data. You can delete saved birthdays or time capsules directly inside the App at any time. Uninstalling the App or clearing app data in your device settings will permanently erase all stored information.
5. Third-Party Services
The App interacts with the following trusted third-party service provider solely to power specific features:

Google Generative AI (Gemini API) — For generating AI-driven insights.
Google Privacy Policy: https://policies.google.com/privacy

6. Children’s Privacy (COPPA Compliance)
Ageo is designed for general audiences and does not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under the age of 13. Since all date-of-birth inputs are processed locally on the user's device and not linked to any personal identity, our application is safe for all age demographics and complies with the Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA).

7. User Rights (GDPR & CCPA Compliance)
Under regulations such as the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), you have the right to access, export, or erase your data.

Because we do not store your data on cloud servers or maintain user accounts, you can exercise these rights directly on your device by:

Viewing or editing your birth date from the Home screen.
Deleting individual saved profiles from the History dialog.
Deleting time capsules via the Time Capsule widget.
Clearing all app storage from your device's Settings > Apps > Ageo > Clear Storage.
8. Security
We prioritize the protection of your information. Because all sensitive calculations and storage occur locally on your device, your data is protected by your device's native operating system security and encryption.

9. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any updates will be reflected on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date. We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically.

